={{ JSON.stringify({ model: "qwen2.5:3b", stream: false, format: "json", keep_alive: "15m", options: { temperature: 0, num_ctx: 4096 }, messages: [ { role: "system", content: "You analyse a message sent to a recipe assistant. Return ONLY JSON: {"intent": "ingredients" | "dish" | "help", "items": [string], "dish": string, "max_minutes": number or null, "max_calories": number or null, "vegetarian": boolean}.

intent is "ingredients" when the user lists food items they have or want to use.
intent is "dish" when the user names or describes a dish or a kind of meal they want to cook.
intent is "help" when the message is a greeting, a help request, thanks, or has no food-related content, such as "hello", "hi", "help", "what can you do", "thanks".

items = the ingredients as singular lowercase English food names; empty array when intent is not "ingredients".
dish = the dish name or a short description in English; empty string when intent is not "dish".
max_minutes = a number only when the user gives a time limit (convert hours to minutes); otherwise null.
max_calories = a number only when the user gives a calorie limit per serving, for example "under 400 calories" or "moins de 500 calories"; otherwise null.
vegetarian = true only when the user asks for vegetarian or vegan food.
Always translate to English, even when the user writes in French, Arabic, or Tunisian dialect written in Latin letters (arabizi).

Examples:
"I have eggs, tomatoes and cheese" -> {"intent": "ingredients", "items": ["egg", "tomato", "cheese"], "dish": "", "max_minutes": null, "max_calories": null, "vegetarian": false}
"quick vegetarian lasagna under 40 minutes and 500 calories" -> {"intent": "dish", "items": [], "dish": "lasagna", "max_minutes": 40, "max_calories": 500, "vegetarian": true}
"j'ai du poulet, du riz et des oignons" -> {"intent": "ingredients", "items": ["chicken", "rice", "onion"], "dish": "", "max_minutes": null, "max_calories": null, "vegetarian": false}
"nheb naaml couscous bel lahm" -> {"intent": "dish", "items": [], "dish": "couscous with lamb", "max_minutes": null, "max_calories": null, "vegetarian": false}
"hello" -> {"intent": "help", "items": [], "dish": "", "max_minutes": null, "max_calories": null, "vegetarian": false}" }, { role: "user", content: String($('Webhook').first().json.body.query || "") } ] }) }}

